.DS_Store
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md §18 — no secret ever enters Git ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars

# --- TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md §19.4 — raw survey sources never enter the repo ---
# "Raw E57/LAS/LAZ source surveys never enter the CMS or the frontend pipeline."
# A point cloud is measurable: raw captures carry georeferencing, provenance and
# client identifiers, and heritage/institutional clients may hold contractual
# restrictions. Only bounded, stripped web derivatives are publishable (§10.2),
# and only with `capturePublicationCleared` set.
#
# Raw / vendor-native capture formats only. Web derivative formats are
# deliberately NOT ignored here — a blanket rule would block the very assets
# §10.2 says the pipeline is meant to produce.
*.e57
*.las
*.laz
*.ptx
*.pts
*.rcp
*.rcs
*.fls
*.fws
*.zfs
*.zfprj

# build output / tooling
dist/
.astro/
node_modules/
.wrangler/
test-results/
playwright-report/
